@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title Verified WASM handoff: producer and consumer

|CI workflow|
start
:Check out PR head or full source_sha;
:Verify commit, tree, Cargo.lock hash;
:Setup (network allowed):
Node 22, Rust stable, npm ci, cargo fetch --locked;
:CARGO_NET_OFFLINE=true npm test
(the single WASM build);
:tools/package-verified-wasm.mjs
-> wasm + verification.json + manifest.json;
:Upload artifact (14-day retention);
|Consumer|
:Download the three files;
:Check formats, pins, tree, lockfile hash;
:Recompute hashes and byte counts;
:Check expected run, commit and workflow
(the zip cannot authorize itself);
stop
@enduml
